<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 159 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 159 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 159 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.2 BLN    1.2 BLN    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY     50 MLN    209 MLN    =	    =</p>
<p> DETAILS</p>
<p> BAND 1 BILLS			   59 MLN*   =	    =</p>
<p> BILLS/FRG NOV 15/18   50 MLN#   100 MLN#   =	    =</p>
<p># INTEREST RATE - 5-31/32 PCT</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-15/16 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
